or Lucia), but character-switching opens up dynamically during Chapter 2[1].\\n\\n---\\n\\n### **Mission Flow & Chapter Breakdown**\\n\\n#### **Prologue**\\n* *Focus:* Introduction to Lucia and the baseline setup[3][4].\\n* **Missions included:** \\n  1. *Prologue* (Lucia and her prison counselor)[3][4]\\n\\n#### **Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise**\\n* *Location:* Leonida Keys / Hamlet Prison / Early smuggling circuits[3][5]\\n* *Overview:* Focuses heavily on Jason, introducing local contacts, odd jobs, and petty smuggling before the narrative scales up[3].\\n* **Selected Mission Flow:**\\n  * *Gone Fishing*[3]\\n  * *Gear Up*[3]\\n  * *Just A Scratch*[3]\\n  * *Lab Fees*[3]\\n  * *Unwanted Attention*[3]\\n  * *Pipework*[3]\\n  * *Hey Arnold!*[3]\\n  * *Island Dreams*[3]\\n  * *Feng Shui*[3]\\n  * *Coming Home*[3]\\n  * *Buck Me*[3]\\n  * *Clean Up After Donnie*[3]\\n  * *Down to Earth*[3]\\n  * *Clear Skies*[3]\\n  * *Day Release*[3]\\n  * *Swamped*[3]\\n  * *Tourist Trap* / *Home Sweet Home* / *Discharge Time* (Point of no return\\n<truncated 583 bytes>\\n:* Transitioning toward Vice City outskirts and regional connections[2]\\n* *Overview:* Mid-game escalation where smuggling rings turn into high-stakes drug operations, laying the groundwork for the migration into the main city[2].\\n\\n#### **Chapter 4: Vice City, Baby**\\n* *Location:* Vice City proper[2]\\n* *Overview:* The largest chunk of the game. Opens up the neon-lit urban core, featuring major setups, elaborate heists, and navigating complex criminal conspiracies[1][2].\\n\\n#### **Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma!**\\n* *Location:* Vice City / Finale locations[2]\\n* *Overview:* The high-stakes culmination of Jason and Lucia's arc, wrapping up loose ends, betrayals, and the ultimate climax of the campaign[1].\\n\\nSources:\\n[1] [clarin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEHmgE9r0iOxoWNwMymCUZG5BmKRV3NqrJxZE17AwTGvK6LM9YYKKLxU1RJKQZMxVql6XS-X5B02zjcKZiDLRuI8ld8f7lIcVbz